  href=3D"javascript:GoToSld('slide0160.htm');" id=3DPPTL13>Image Subtracti=
on</a></font></div>
  <div id=3DPPTC13 class=3DCTxt style=3D'display:none'><font size=3D2>
  <ul>
   <li>Useful for finding changes between two images of (basically) the same
       scene.</li>
   <li>C[x, y] =3D A[x, y] - B[x, y]</li>
   <li>More useful to use absolute difference</li>
   <li>C[x, y] =3D |A[x, y] - B[x, y]|</li>
   <br>
   <br>
  </ul>
  </font></div>
  </td>
 </tr>
